{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingNoneCardTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingNoneCardTitle", "text": "Nothing stood out, so nothing was asked", "sha256": "27608144c6740387333bd95759cac7720ca6a8718594e71c5a9bc2669dab8b34", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingNoneCardBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingNoneCardBody", "text": "The sweep runs on this phone. It only calls a model when it has a finding to hand it, and today it had none.", "sha256": "ca0baf0d7d530923e6a81bd67ab8a02e8745b8df6feb86aa33e725411035fdef", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingEmptyCardTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingEmptyCardTitle", "text": "Nothing was available to send", "sha256": "18e24924491b0fe2e879f161cc3dcefb667e1875d46b5f57b0256c3dae568c65", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingEmptyCardBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingEmptyCardBody", "text": "No metric had a value when this was written, so the prompt carried none.", "sha256": "9b5757ecb0e15fe9de6543fa5eedbe485b55fbdaaba321210439da9c6932d796", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsFellAsleepHelp", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsFellAsleepHelp", "text": "WHEN YOU FELL ASLEEP", "sha256": "2d036911d563029de40382b83d39442cac8da28bb311fb44a348e91361e8ac81", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsWokeUpHelp", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsWokeUpHelp", "text": "WHEN YOU WOKE UP", "sha256": "a4821fae0cc9137d4a7e688913fc16cac63a432730ed326cd8bb7844c273a28f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsInvalidWindow", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsInvalidWindow", "text": "A nap is between 5 minutes and 6 hours. Anything longer is a sleep, and it belongs in the night where the stages can be read.", "sha256": "d5e7c6987e0f8479a60d6b6e809dba7ec0e039031eb8bf9571cad447ccff0b20", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsOverlap", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsOverlap", "text": "That overlaps a nap already on this day. Remove that one first, rather than counting the same hour twice.", "sha256": "23506bb07b877b38c17af71589ab2ad033a5ac73d294c3fa04ae8ef824eb84a2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsNotReanalysed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsNotReanalysed", "text": "The day was not re-analysed — another analysis was already running. Your edit is saved and will apply next time.", "sha256": "6c4c8bd6e49df7728e7aca21098e7ffb8b0239e7c6d861c2c135a1f4ddca34aa", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsTitle", "text": "Naps", "sha256": "90cf0f1d8fbdc4ba984bd078806da98dc4333a709a8b7ee749ec136e156e06fe", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsNoReadingTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsNoReadingTitle", "text": "No nap reading for this day", "sha256": "f139b8eb3ba61027e39249c0311ce3da7edcd320a7634f980193174854a7292a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsNoReadingBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsNoReadingBody", "text": "Naps are worked out from the same 1 Hz recording the rest of the day is, and this day does not have enough of it.", "sha256": "2e3fcbf8fdd3ea5baff85bd5d3dce9246785c770a3b0a3a1a66756ae4e3b046d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsEmptyTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsEmptyTitle", "text": "No naps on this day", "sha256": "9e2a0bad5248567a08238fee9db7acc102237240add92beb254f04e40371e9ed", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:napsEmptyBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "napsEmptyBody", "text": "Nothing on this day was still enough, for long enough, with the heart-rate dip that goes with sleeping through it.", "sha256": "0b2ce5afb9a4021b0cffa14b215fa942fe3c0bdde337ec2a95865636e942c7c4", "kind": "arb"}
