{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStepsCounted", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStepsCounted", "text": "Counted", "sha256": "c037c15990c592791fc90ae5a033c6706538119572665ffa9c9987d2eab26f91", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStepsHonestyMixed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStepsHonestyMixed", "text": "Counted at your wrist and by your phone, and the two miscount differently: a wrist reads a real walk low and can read rhythmic hand work as walking, while a phone counts only the steps you had it on you for.", "sha256": "f88839f4a50d87f2f9e77be4df5d54c917133220b61e3f4c5950040bb11f8ffd", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStepsHonestyStrap", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStepsHonestyStrap", "text": "Counted at your wrist, where a real walk tends to read low and rhythmic hand work can read as walking.", "sha256": "c52e76685ec426ef5e3b35ef830cc23a65c8c6a9ce8ca9a1ae6569385ebbf927", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:dayStepsHonestyPhone", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "dayStepsHonestyPhone", "text": "Counted by your phone, so only the steps you had it on you for are here.", "sha256": "3e68eaa0066d78e4e00532ce30f8e2ed63f522e99cf2db441047740c70fbe2ea", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightSignRhr", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightSignRhr", "text": "your resting heart rate ran higher", "sha256": "674170606c145bfa01168543b77fe2cfe86328efbcf04f40bfefc91724b066a7", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightSignHrv", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightSignHrv", "text": "your HRV ran lower", "sha256": "23d86153be44be656a5e814cfb4f0a0d00865a98d666cdf82d86a02226521ae3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightSignDip", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightSignDip", "text": "your heart rate dropped less overnight than it usually does", "sha256": "0359d88e8b6934f4e4b2e053fc20f3b60c774cad2ae407533a8d9a75c41606f0", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightSignTemp", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightSignTemp", "text": "your skin ran warmer", "sha256": "f4db8b2627a27e42dfc323c3dd1706447d85535543d0fab4952f4a50fddaf3de", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightLateTraining", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightLateTraining", "text": "You trained until {at}, which often does this on its own.", "sha256": "00d91533d5ae537eab4d3ad6e6b9da40512173f8d3b761df024c1612ab426d37", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightIllness", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightIllness", "text": "The illness watch flagged this night too — a sustained rise against your own baseline, not a diagnosis.", "sha256": "2bc0c7ad4edf048ec6576e4dcfead4958dbe923347a263a5e13f81931a57691d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightLuteal", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightLuteal", "text": "You are in the luteal phase, which lifts resting heart rate and skin temperature by itself.", "sha256": "601996663a7f1aab4cdfad4e34f8580f40703ef3205dab9d3bba9ea1acc6555e", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightWarmRoom", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightWarmRoom", "text": "Your skin ran warmer than your usual — a warm room does this too.", "sha256": "3bd05ff56526b661c0159566a4fd076f002767a3d524bc0b0eda736e9603e0a1", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightDismiss", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightDismiss", "text": "Dismiss", "sha256": "48845bff334a50a59aaecf499f28a7a24c3b4b891b8b18a9f1169ad8e8a6b261", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightDefaultHeadline", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightDefaultHeadline", "text": "A rougher night than usual", "sha256": "ebbc7e8c1738888ee3f97faa86b507b98ca368cfaa4ac0e41263a3f0f00445fc", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightSummary", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightSummary", "text": "{sentence}, against your own nights. This is a measurement of the night, not a verdict on you.", "sha256": "8db0d8323f02ab02a74f3f45e7a2d6f4c48348dd8befa5897bf5453146b437ca", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightTellWhatHappened", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightTellWhatHappened", "text": "Tell it what happened", "sha256": "c83e0dc0c9d1660e3f26353752e351a64e699e7c55fb48fa211c111e891f0d58", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightNothingToAnswer", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightNothingToAnswer", "text": "Nothing to answer — this card only reports the night.", "sha256": "35de2fc6533a98cf86d1ff9e66ab5f2398f9afc7f01e81d481b795ab7ea4e23b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:roughNightWhatElse", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "roughNightWhatElse", "text": "What else was going on?", "sha256": "4c40a39b2666431dce2acd1b8d05c14b904fa18a3733a008d75cb91976daf205", "kind": "arb"}
